WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.200
many children across the english-speaking world&nbsp;
grew up hearing mother goose nursery rhymes about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:11.600
mice running up clocks old women living in shoes&nbsp;
and one unfortunate egg by the name of humpty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:17.120
dumpty but have you ever heard the rhyme about the&nbsp;
crooked man most of us who heard that particular&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:24.240
poem remember it like this there was a crooked man&nbsp;
and he walked a crooked mile he found a crooked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:30.560
sixpence against a crooked style he bought a&nbsp;
crooked cat which caught a crooked mouse and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:37.840
they all live together in a little crooked house&nbsp;
a little bit odd but hey most nursery rhymes are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:43.440
when have you ever seen a little girl sitting on&nbsp;
a tuffet eating some curds and whey what even is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:49.920
tuffet honestly what are curds and whey let's just&nbsp;
move on residents of the sleepy english hamlet of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:56.880
tembi and oxfordshire hear a more menacing version&nbsp;
of the rhyme about the crooked man sung as a song&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:02.960
on playgrounds shared in hushed tones when the&nbsp;
grown-ups aren't listening it goes like this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:09.760
there lived a crooked man who made a crooked deal&nbsp;
he kept a crooked cane and his catch in crooked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:16.960
creel he stole a crooked child who cried a crooked&nbsp;
squeal and that crooked little man was broken&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:23.360
on the wheel it sounds just as inscrutible as any&nbsp;
other nursery rhyme but there is a dark tone to it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:28.800
that seems a bit out of place especially when you&nbsp;
compare it to the other somewhat cheery version&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:34.400
this creepy alternative to the crooked man nursery&nbsp;
rhyme seems to only be found in the town of tembi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:40.400
and unfortunately for the residents of that&nbsp;
town there is a deadly truth behind its words&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:46.240
many years ago the scp foundation became aware&nbsp;
of a mysterious pattern in this unassuming town&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:52.960
every 12 years over a period of roughly 70 days&nbsp;
something horrible would happen to townspeople&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:58.640
who happened to be alone and indoors after dark&nbsp;
when they were discovered by a neighbor a family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:05.120
member a friend or even the police they would be&nbsp;
unresponsive suffering from full-body paralysis&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:10.240
or appearing to be effectively brain dead&nbsp;
this was not the most unusual aspect of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:16.960
phenomenon though the victims were all grotesquely&nbsp;
transformed their long bones covered in dozens of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:23.040
compound fractures combined with excess cartilage&nbsp;
and osseous tissue their limbs would become&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:29.440
distended stretched and deformed into long gnarled&nbsp;
appendages like the limbs of an ancient tree&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:34.720
one of the recovered victims had a forearm&nbsp;
measured at over 2.4 meters long another had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:40.000
to be placed in a specially outfitted hospital&nbsp;
bed as his spine and legs had stretched to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:46.720
point where he was 12.5 meters tall local police&nbsp;
and doctors alike were left scratching their heads&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:51.120
what had happened to these people clearly&nbsp;
something horrible had been done to them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:56.560
but there was no actual evidence of a crime no&nbsp;
one had been murdered and there was no evidence&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.560 --> 00:03:03.520
of forced entry at any of the victims homes there&nbsp;
was however one other piece to the crooked puzzle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:08.960
just before a victim was found their place of&nbsp;
residence would visibly degrade and warp the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:14.960
structure itself breaking in places until portions&nbsp;
collapsed in or became slanted roofs would tilt at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:21.360
an unsafe angle chimneys would fold over and door&nbsp;
frames would twist until no ordinary person could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:26.800
pass through them safely this happened every&nbsp;
12 years for decades and none of the people of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:32.400
tembe could do anything about it in fact they&nbsp;
rarely ever so much as spoke of it terrified&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:38.480
of admitting the truth of their town's curse in so&nbsp;
many words instead they spoke about the phenomenon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:44.800
in innuendo meaningful glances and pleas to keep&nbsp;
loved ones company at night and through a simple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:50.160
children's rhyme one doctor tasked with treating&nbsp;
survivors of the horror decided to do something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:56.400
as the 12 year mark began to approach once more he&nbsp;
reached out to a researcher he had known years ago&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:02.960
a man who specialized in the unexplained things&nbsp;
that modern medicine had no answer for this man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:08.880
had left medicine behind and was now working&nbsp;
for the scp foundation at the time of contact&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:14.240
there were approximately six months to go until&nbsp;
the phenomenon would begin to strike once more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:18.400
the foundation needed to act quickly&nbsp;
in order to collect more information&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:23.680
and hopefully find a way to stop the terror&nbsp;
of tembi once and for all with about a month&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:30.640
to go until the danger would reappear a member of&nbsp;
d-class personnel referred to as d-209 was placed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:35.360
in a foundation-owned house in town audio and&nbsp;
visual equipment were installed throughout the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:41.120
house in order to monitor it for any anomalous&nbsp;
activity and to make sure d-209 remained at his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:47.120
post for the first month of his stay d-209 did&nbsp;
not experience anything unusual he spent his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:52.160
time drinking tea baking pies and catching up&nbsp;
on his reading he even thanked the foundation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.160 --> 00:05:00.560
for the unexpected staycation unfortunately on&nbsp;
his 43rd day in tembi things changed as d209 sat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:06.400
in bed reading a novel by the lamplight the camera&nbsp;
feed in the living room began to glitch a vertical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:11.200
distortion appeared with a jagged pattern that&nbsp;
began to make its way across the room from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:16.400
front door it was as if something was coming&nbsp;
inside but the camera could not pick up its&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:22.080
image the distortion continued through the hallway&nbsp;
until the camera placed there cut out entirely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:28.080
suddenly closed his book as the sound&nbsp;
of scratching came from the floor below&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:33.040
he began to slowly climb out of bed listening&nbsp;
for further sounds as the entity continued to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:38.240
make its way through the house toward him movement&nbsp;
was apparent on the video feed but there was too&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:44.240
much interference for any image of the creature to&nbsp;
be made out d-209 froze in his tracks as he heard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:49.840
footsteps slow and certain coming up the stairs&nbsp;
toward him he ran to the window attempting to pry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:55.280
it open and make an escape but it would not budge&nbsp;
with increasing desperation he grabbed his bedside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.280 --> 00:06:00.320
lamp and threw it at the window attempting&nbsp;
to shatter the glass the lamp broke apart&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:05.680
but the window remained stubbornly intact as he&nbsp;
scrambled for an escape route something knocked at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:13.040
his bedroom door d-209 called out toward the door&nbsp;
who is it who's there but there was no response&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:18.320
identify yourself still whatever stood on the&nbsp;
other side said nothing holding the remains of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:24.880
the lamp in one hand as a makeshift weapon d-209&nbsp;
slowly reached for the doorknob and opened the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:30.800
door with a sudden pop every light bulb in the&nbsp;
vicinity burst including foundation provided&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:36.560
floodlights positioned outside of the house there&nbsp;
was the sound of snapping and then an agonized&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:42.720
scream the camera adjusted to the lack of light&nbsp;
in the room allowing for a clear image of d209&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:47.760
he was wailing and holding his right arm which&nbsp;
appeared to be broken just above the elbow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:52.800
the arm began to stiffen and elongate&nbsp;
indicating impossibly fast bone growth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:58.320
screw this you're not taking me i'm getting out&nbsp;
of here alive he yelled running down the hallway&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:04.720
he collapsed as another snapping sound echoed&nbsp;
throughout the hall my legs broken set out please&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:11.360
he called to someone anyone who might be watching&nbsp;
the feed slowly painfully he pulled himself to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:16.800
his feet he lifted his right arm to the camera&nbsp;
showing that it had been broken again below the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:23.120
elbow pointing in the opposite direction of the&nbsp;
first break what are you doing help me he screamed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:28.720
it it doesn't even hurt anymore that can't be&nbsp;
right i don't know what's happening to me as he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:34.080
continued to yell at the cameras he limped towards&nbsp;
the stairs attempting to make his way down to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:40.560
first floor he missed a step lost his balance&nbsp;
and fell all the way down twelve loud snaps were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:46.480
heard as he went when he landed on the ground his&nbsp;
bones were broken in several other places only to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:52.000
be immediately set where they had broken as he&nbsp;
screamed he dragged himself into the living room&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:57.200
battling against his own body which had become&nbsp;
something foreign to him his arms were growing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:03.440
longer now around two meters long and his legs&nbsp;
stretched out of the camera's view presumably into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:15.200
the hallway suddenly he stopped crawling his eyes&nbsp;
widening no no no no he whimpered before suddenly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:20.000
being dragged backwards out of the camera's view&nbsp;
due to the presence of the entity interfering&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:26.320
with the cameras all visibility was lost at this&nbsp;
point there was however still a live audio feed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:33.200
the microphones picked up an hour of snapping&nbsp;
and screaming until d-209 eventually went quiet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:39.760
then all that could be heard was a wet sucking&nbsp;
sound followed by a thumping meanwhile at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:47.200
hospital 27 other victims of the entity were lying&nbsp;
in hospital beds as d209 met his unfortunate fate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:52.480
all of the hospitalized victims began to&nbsp;
experience seizures at the same time and seized&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:58.480
for several minutes five patients were killed&nbsp;
and two researchers were injured in the chaos&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:02.800
after the incident at the hospital reports&nbsp;
of a seismic event at the edge of town began&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:07.760
to circulate because there had been no actual&nbsp;
earthquake in the area the research team realized&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:13.040
that this disturbance had to be somehow related&nbsp;
to the phenomenon they planned to investigate in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:19.760
order to learn more about the entity behind it all&nbsp;
which they had now officially designated scp-783&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:24.960
the crooked man a team of personnel were sent&nbsp;
to investigate the site of the seismic event&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:30.480
only to find a group of 10b townsfolk clustered&nbsp;
around the area in a field at the south of town&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:35.760
the crowd refused to let the researchers&nbsp;
through and would not budge until one researcher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:41.920
agent collins pulled out her firearm and fired a&nbsp;
shot into the air the sound frightened the crowd&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:46.400
and they realized this mysterious foundation&nbsp;
really meant business where the crowd had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:54.320
been agent collins could see toes unnaturally&nbsp;
long crooked toes poking up out of the ground&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.320 --> 00:10:00.480
they were going to need some help and a lot more&nbsp;
shovels to uncover this mystery by the next day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:07.280
a dig team had uncovered a mass grave filled with&nbsp;
victims of scp-783 there were dozens of elongated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:12.720
bodies spread throughout the five meter wide hole&nbsp;
stacked on top of each other with their heads&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:18.480
facing down and their arms outstretched towards&nbsp;
the bottom of the pit their limbs had grown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:23.920
around each other twisting together to the point&nbsp;
where they could not be removed one at a time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:29.040
while trying to collect a tissue sample from one&nbsp;
of the bodies researcher singer lost his balance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:34.720
as the ground beneath him gave way and he fell&nbsp;
he attempted to find a foothold and climb back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:40.800
up but fell through the gnarled arms and down into&nbsp;
the pit thinking quickly agent collins grabbed a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:46.000
rope and tied it around her waist she would lower&nbsp;
herself down into the grave and would signal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:52.560
when she was ready for them to pull her out agent&nbsp;
collins descended into the pit over 20 meters down&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:58.640
before she signaled for the team to pull her&nbsp;
back out then she told them what she had seen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:05.280
there was something down there the entrance to&nbsp;
another location beneath all of the bodies someone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:12.000
asked if there was any sign of researcher singer&nbsp;
colin shook her head face growing pale she hadn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:18.960
seen him down there he was gone agent collins was&nbsp;
granted a temporary leave of absence and a d-class&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:25.920
d-2172 was selected for further exploration of&nbsp;
the anomalous mass grave he was outfitted with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:32.640
a retractable harness communication and video&nbsp;
equipment as well as a photo ionization detector&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:40.480
a geiger counter a basic survival kit a firearm&nbsp;
and ammunition d2172 was then lowered into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:47.440
pit via a crane after 12 meters of descent there&nbsp;
was no longer any visible light inside the pit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:56.240
and d 2172 switched on his headlamp a few moments&nbsp;
later d-2172 began tugging on the tether demanding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.240 --> 00:12:02.960
to be lowered more quickly when asked why he&nbsp;
insisted someone just touched my back at 18 meters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:10.400
down d2172 began to feel a sense of confusion&nbsp;
and dizziness unable to tell which direction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:18.160
he was going at this point in the pit gravity&nbsp;
had inverted forcing d-2172 to climb upward&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:23.840
in order to continue moving down as he crossed&nbsp;
into another world there was daylight visible here&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:31.760
again as d2172 climbed out from within the mass&nbsp;
of bodies there he found a seemingly identical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:37.760
version of the town of tembi he was instructed to&nbsp;
take soil samples and the monitoring researcher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:43.680
noticed something odd on the video feed there were&nbsp;
marks in the dirt around the grave that appeared&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:51.760
to have been made by fingers pulling across the&nbsp;
ground they decided not to relay this to d2172&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:58.000
after the soil samples came up normal d2172&nbsp;
was instructed to walk to a nearby cottage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:03.840
and look for any sign of the missing researcher&nbsp;
singer he knocked on the door and with no answer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:10.960
let himself in he saw no one inside and began to&nbsp;
walk through in the bedroom on the wall there was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:16.480
a charcoal sketch of a humanoid figure holding&nbsp;
a staff of some kind command ordered him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:22.720
approach the drawing but he protested saying he&nbsp;
felt incredibly uncomfortable looking at it he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:29.760
relented and began to approach but as he did the&nbsp;
quality of the video feed began to degrade until&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:36.560
it was filled with static d2172 was then permitted&nbsp;
to leave the cottage and further explore this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:43.840
copycat village while walking further into the&nbsp;
village d2172 spotted a work boot on the ground he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:48.960
picked it up and found it was a match for the one&nbsp;
researcher singer had been wearing he followed the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:56.160
path to another house the door of which was wide&nbsp;
open he walked inside to find signs of a struggle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:56.160 --> 00:14:02.880
an overturned couch and table a hole in the wall&nbsp;
the broken pieces of a lamp scattered on the floor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:08.960
the kitchen was just as much of a mess and as he&nbsp;
investigated it further he found a pool of blood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:14.880
on the floor with significant blood splatter on&nbsp;
the walls and counter it looked like someone had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:23.280
been attacked with a weapon likely a knife indeed&nbsp;
as he looked d 2172 spotted a butcher's block&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:29.920
with only one empty slot the one that should have&nbsp;
held a meat cleaver the investigation led him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:36.240
a locked door covered in scratches he broke it&nbsp;
down and nearly fell down the stairs into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:43.120
darkened basement instructed to head down into&nbsp;
the basement d-2172 switched on his headlamp&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:49.360
drew his weapon and descended into the darkness&nbsp;
the basement was empty except for a bloody meat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:56.160
cleaver and a piece of pant leg caught inside an&nbsp;
exhaust vent leading out of the house the pants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:56.160 --> 00:15:03.360
resembled those worn by singer before his fall d&nbsp;
2172 peered into the vent for a closer look but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:09.840
was startled by the sight of something scuttling&nbsp;
out of sight whatever it was it was fleshy and it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:17.600
was not something he cared to see more of d2172&nbsp;
continued on his expedition walking north and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:24.400
away from the town limits of tembi somehow in&nbsp;
spite of this he wound back up at the south side&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:31.360
where he had emerged from the pit but something&nbsp;
was different there were no bodies no open grave&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:38.080
and no tethered harness that he had taken off when&nbsp;
he climbed out he was trapped the harness had not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:44.960
been retracted so where had it gone command could&nbsp;
not determine its exact location but proposed that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:52.160
d2172 had entered another anomalous area and&nbsp;
was not in fact back where he started he was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:57.680
instructed to follow the road back retracing&nbsp;
his steps until he wound up at the pit again&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:03.920
as he walked he commented that he had not yet&nbsp;
seen a single living thing in this place then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:11.760
as he heard the sound of rustling leaves he turned&nbsp;
toward it to find the corpse of an scp-783 victim&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:18.000
he turned back to continue on his way only to see&nbsp;
another victim sprawled across the road he drew&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:24.000
his weapon then listening as the rustling began&nbsp;
again he spun around to look at the body behind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:30.960
him and found that it had stretched longer growing&nbsp;
closer to him behind him the other body began to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:36.880
snap as well he turned to fire his weapon and&nbsp;
saw that this other body had stretched its neck&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:44.240
its head at eye level only a meter away from his&nbsp;
own face he fired several rounds but the corpse&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:51.920
did not respond ignoring orders d-2172 took off&nbsp;
running into the woods leaving the road behind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:58.160
he stopped to catch his breath sat down and&nbsp;
reloaded his firearm after eating a quick mre&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:03.600
and informing command of his whereabouts he set&nbsp;
back off on his journey through the forest after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:10.400
14 minutes of walking he began to feel movement&nbsp;
under the ground short sharp bursts of motion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:16.400
reverberating through the earth he could also&nbsp;
hear a thumping sound coming from beneath him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:21.680
on the video feed command saw what appeared&nbsp;
to be a silver birch tree lifting out of sight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:29.520
then dropping down back into the forest shaking&nbsp;
the ground on impact d-2172 was instructed to&nbsp;&nbsp;

